          "FirstWeekRow now matches Foundations: trailing dismiss button ('Dismiss next step'), InlineUndo 'Hidden from Today · Undo', step strings from the set. Steps reordered to pickup, then reminder or widget, then one date or person, with the tier rule reworded; the 'Skip' word moved to Notes as a proposed Foundations change.",
