          "Declared ScaleStrip V9/V10 overrides under FOUNDATIONS COMPONENTS USED and listed them as contract updates on Notes (review minor)",
          "Expired banner now carries the trailing 'Close' action at 44px in COPY and frame 07 (Foundations V5)",
          "Unchecked token card shows no ProvenanceMarks; 'couldn't check' line sits above rows; offline variant drops Retry; new frame 09 for the online-failed expanded case (review minor)",
          "Frame 04 places the privacy line under the field above suggestions and hides the WallBar while the keyboard is open (flow step 7, review minor)",
          "Added heading structure: single h1, 'Your place' h2, Dana's card as a labelled region; DOM order matches visual (review minor)",
