                    "evidence": "research-findings.md:826 \"Reserve the provenance sheet's 'This isn't right' for public-record facts, not for photo reads.\" f10-bill-provenance (FINAL inventory:575) \"'View the photo', 'Fix what we read'\". component-contract ProvenanceMark: read-from-your-photo \"becomes you-added on commit\". The prompt's 'Report area by fact type' covers only Schedule, Flood, Radon, Air, Seeded deadline and You added.",
                    "fix": "Add a 'Read from your photo' entry under 'Report area by fact type'. It gets no 'This isn't right'. It shows the tick mark (committed), the primary text action 'Fix what we read' (which reopens extraction confirm) and 'View the photo'. It is visible only to people with finance.view. Update artboard 29 to match."
