                    "evidence": "inventory-entries: payload {value, bands, authority, as_of, confidence, source_url, rule_id}. research-findings.md:1712 \"Tapping the row opens x-provenance-sheet, which holds method, resolution, effective date, the full EPA health statement\". research-findings.md:1709 \"A legend of band definitions is one tap away in the provenance sheet.\" flows-spec flow-05 step 10 \"reads the method, the effective date\". The prompt's LAYOUT draws only AqiBand for air, with no ScaleStrip or band definitions for P2 and P5.",
