                    "evidence": "The prompt reads: \"Member view (Sam): the warranty (Only you) is hidden and not counted, so the count is '10 on file'.\" MONEY reads: \"You and Sam can see these.\" DateRow states include: \"permission-hidden (no ghost row)\". Brief: the self-report \"stays Only you\".",
