                    "evidence": "critique-findings.md: \"the Place dashboard's first load after accept says which address Today now uses and why, reusing f1-location-source-sheet rather than changing silently.\" FINAL MERGES: \"Saved-places list + 'Where Today gets this' sheet → ONE 'Your places' surface\". Prompt EDGE CASES only says: \"A household member such as Sam Ortega sees 2418 NE Larkspur Loop with \\\"Your household\\\" and \\\"Joined\\\"\".",
