                    "issue": "The saved-place caption is tied to the wrong condition. The prompt says 'pickup frequency not set', but the honesty rule is that pickup is pushed only once the person has set the pickup day. Confirming the weekday is enough, as the pickup-card prompt says.",
                    "evidence": "Design doc F4: 'Never push a pickup for a saved place without a user-set day (F5).' The pickup-card prompt says: 'A saved place with no day set by the person never gets a push' and 'No night-before reminder until you confirm your day.' This prompt says: 'Saved place, PLACE B, pickup frequency not set. Row 1 caption: \"Pickup joins once you set your pickup day...\"' and 'Jordan Lee... has not set his pickup frequency.'",
                    "fix": "Change the condition to 'PLACE B, pickup day not yet set by Jordan (city weekday only, hollow)'. State that the caption disappears once he confirms his weekday, even if frequency is still Not set."
                  },
