                    "evidence": "'draw one TextActionRow, \"Briefings are now on Today and in Notification settings\", linking to Notification settings'. Contract TextActionRow: 'Tertiary spread actions (share, compare, outbound)'. FINAL inventory: 'Three Todays → ONE Today per platform'.",
                    "fix": "Draw it as a FactRow (known variant, trailing chevron) with the label 'Briefings' and the value 'Now on Today and in Notification settings'. Add to Notes: 'Draw this only if Place > Today still ships before the Today merge.'"
