              "Split artboard 11 into 11-paused-timezone (status line hidden, 'Pickup reminders pause too.') and 12-quiet-night ('Skipped Sun 18 Oct — nothing needed you', household master off); renumbered to 22 artboards and rebatched (review major, invariant 4)",
