              "Now available rows use GrantLimitList strings, remove any 0% marketplace fee line, and fix Block Founder / Founding Neighbor naming (derive f9-founding-promise-copy; review major)",
              "Household-already-has-pickup-day and kept-keeper states marked unreachable under the timing model and moved to Notes with copy, including a new kept-keeper string; frame 11 annotation removed",
              "Pickup caption uses the canonical ScopeChip sentence 'Everyone in this household will see this.'",
              "Method line reads 'Address verified by postcard · Mon 19 Oct' (glossary forbids 'confirm'); contract example discrepancy noted",
              "Per-date visibility control lives in the Date sheet and on the place-file row (research); frame 14 shows it",
              "Different-address line gains '· Your places', opening Your places (critique)",
              "KeeperStrip species avatar scaled to the 24pt KindGlyph slot, flagged as a Foundations item on Notes",
