              "Decline renamed 'Keep them to myself'; both consent buttons filled primary.700, same size, stacked at 390 and AX5",
              "Count rule reworded: summary counts carried rows only; the failed item is a separate uncounted InlineErrorRow",
              "FactCount set to '14 on file' to match the place file header; Notes requires one integer across surfaces",
              "Focus moves to the result line (and Undo) after a choice",
              "Receipt timing reworded: appears when the claim finishes, again at verification if the question is unanswered",
