                    "issue": "The prompt contradicts itself about when the sheet can appear. One section says it opens only on a device that has never shown the system dialog, but three artboards draw the sheet in denied states. On iOS, a device in the denied state has by definition already shown the dialog. Claude Design will draw frames that no stated entry point can reach, and engineering will not know when to present them.",
