                    "fix": "Replace the sentence with: \"It opens automatically only after the first confirmed pickup day saves, and only while the phone has never been asked. After a denial it opens only when the person taps 'Turn on' in the Mail push-off banner, and then in its denied variant: iOS denied → Open Settings + Close; Android denied once → Continue (asks again) + Not now; Android blocked → Open Settings + Not now. It never opens by itself after a denial.\" In artboard lines 7-9, add \"(over Mail, from 'Turn on')\"."
