                    "evidence": "EDGE CASES: 'A date 12 or more months ahead gets the suggested fix.' CONTENT: 'Likely typo: Wed 29 Sep 2027.' COPY: 'That's almost a year away. Did you mean Tue 29 Sep 2026?' TODAY is Mon 19 Oct 2026 (house style).",
                    "fix": "Set the threshold below the example, e.g. \"A date more than 90 days ahead gets the suggested fix; the likely-typo case is the same day and month one year later.\" Or pick an example that is 12 or more months out and update the copy to match. Record the rule on Notes."
