                    "evidence": "Contract ScopeChip: 'footer sentence form (sheets): … \"Everyone in this household will see this.\"' Contract DateSheet anatomy: '…ReminderLeadControl. Footer ScopeChip sentence. Primary Save. Visible Close.' Prompt: 'Under Home Info, draw the ScopeChip sentence \"Everyone in this household will see this.\" once' and it lists only 'Hide the \"Not sure of the day\" toggle'.",
