                    "evidence": "\"$142.18 · due Fri 23 Oct · Larkspur Loop · Today\"; \"Sat 7 Nov, 9:00 AM · Larkspur Loop · Today\". House style: \"beyond tomorrow, add the relative count: 'in 7 days · Mon 26 Oct'\".",
                    "fix": "In-app captions: \"$142.18 · due in 4 days · Fri 23 Oct · Larkspur Loop · Today\" and \"in 19 days · Sat 7 Nov, 9:00 AM · Larkspur Loop · Today\". Push bodies keep the short form."
                  },
                  {
                    "severity": "minor",
