                    "evidence": "COPY: \"'Jenna's guest access ended'\". Frame 04: \"all read, plus the Priya joined row\" only.",
                    "fix": "Add to frame 04 a read system row \"Jenna's guest access ended\" / \"Tue 20 Oct\", with no place label."
