                    "issue": "The share-card size spec may not be buildable. It asks for text at least 40px cap height in a 520px column holding four rows. Full value strings such as 'Zone 1 — highest potential (county)' will not fit at that size. The OG research limits image text to layer names, band names, marks with words, the sender line and 'Yours?'. The contract also gives a track height of at least 30px on the OG card, and the prompt leaves that out.",
                    "evidence": "Prompt: \"At share-card size (520 of 1200), text is at least 40px cap height, marks are at least 28px\". per-surface-changes/f8-og-compare-card.md: \"Only these appear in the image: layer names, band names, marks with printed words, sender line, 'Yours?'\". component-contract.md ScaleStrip: \"Track height 12pt at detail size, 30px or more on the OG card.\"",
                    "fix": "State which text appears at share-card size: the row name plus the short band or value form, for example \"Flood · Zone X\", with the full strings kept in og:description and og:image:alt. Add \"track at least 30px tall\"."
