                    "evidence": "FINAL-screen-inventory.md (f6): \"Entry: … Compare scale strip tap (the in-app twin of the share card)\"; (f1-today-air-band): \"Entry: … Compare scale strip 'Air today' row\". prompts-v1: \"Reached by: … a tap on any scale strip on a shared card\". Prompt: \"A row tap opens ProvenanceSheet\".",
