                    "evidence": "component-contract.md ScaleStrip copyRules: \"Approved strings: … 'Wildfire hazard potential: Moderate · 3 of 5'\"; Variants: \"sender pointer labelled with first name above\". The f8-compare-sheet toggle is off by default, so anonymous cards are the default case.",
