                    "evidence": "Prompt: \"the upper pointer reads 'Dana · 42 Good · Sat 12 Sep' and the lower reads 'You · 42 Good · today 5:00 PM'. Those two never merge into 'Same band', because their dates differ.\" Frame 5: \"Flood, wildfire and radon each show a merged 'Same band' marker; Dana's flood value carries a hollow mark\". 00b V5: \"Air: … Both are in Good, 'Same band'. … Value line 'Both: AQI 42 · Good'. The row shows two captions, one per line: 'Dana: AirNow · on Sat 12 Sep 2026' and 'You: AirNow · observed 7:00 AM'.\"",
