                    "evidence": "flows-spec.md flow-05 step 8: \"Maya's filled mark and his ringed 'You' mark\".",
                    "fix": "Add to Notes: \"flow-05 step 8 must read 'labelled ▼ Dana / ▲ You pointers of the same form'; sender renamed Maya → Dana per the house style fixtures.\""
