                    "fix": "Replace WHO AND WHEN with: \"Someone new at PLACE B: a signed-out visitor who moved to Camas this month. On the fixture TODAY (Mon 19 Oct, 6:10 PM) they type 1107 NE Birchfield Ct, Camas, WA 98607 into the iPhone app. They want to send the readings to a friend without sending their address.\" Delete \"Date every frame Mon 19 Oct...\" and delete the Notes line \"Record the Sat 10 Oct persona moment against the Mon 19 Oct frame date.\""
