                    "fix": "Change the description to: \"Camas, WA: flood zone X, minimal flood hazard (FEMA); wildfire hazard moderate, 3 of 5 (USFS); air on Mon 19 Oct good, AQI 42 (AirNow); radon zone 1, highest potential for the county (EPA). Yours?\""
