                    "evidence": "Prompt: \"Detail: \\\"Air: Good · air quality index (AQI) 42, observed 7:00 AM.\\\"\" and \"Source: \\\"AirNow, FEMA, NWS · this area · checked 6:00 PM\\\"\". component-contract.md OfflineNotice: \"FreshnessLine in its offline variant at the top, plus a per-control reason caption\". Artboard 14 lists only \"the outbound row disabled, with its reason\".",
                    "fix": "Change the calm detail to \"observed 5:00 PM\" (invented; list on Notes). In artboard 14 add \"the host's FreshnessLine 'You're offline · as of 6:04 PM' above the card\", matching f8-native-share-compare."
