                    "fix": "Detail: \"Moved from Sat 31 Oct because that date is a Saturday.\" Worst case: \"Clark County property tax, second half, is due Mon 2 Nov — moved from Sat 31 Oct because that date is a weekend.\" Cut at 90 characters at a word boundary, and label it on Notes as a synthetic stress string."
