                    "evidence": "How-to: \"'Curbside by 6:30 AM · [ProvenanceMark XS, unconfirmed] Unconfirmed · Waste Connections'\" and \"'AQI 42 · Good · AirNow 7:00 AM' beside the micro band\". 00a/00b: 'On record, not confirmed' and 'Air · Good 42'.",
                    "fix": "Copy the preview strings from the reconciled f7-today-widget artboard 01 exactly, and state \"the preview is f7-today-widget 01 (medium) / 16 (4x2) as reconciled with 00b; do not redraw it\"."
