                    "fix": "Add these strings. Row C expanded: \"A badge next to your name on posts once 10 neighbors join with your link.\" Row D expanded: \"The Block Builder badge next to your name once 25 neighbors join.\" Row B expanded, when locked: \"See homes and posts for every block on the Nearby map.\" Place \"Only you will see this.\" as the card's last line, under the FreshnessLine."
                  },
                  {
                    "severity": "minor",
                    "issue": "Entry (c) has a landing (a highlight plus focus on the title), but no frame draws it. Entry (b) introduces a string on another surface without listing it.",
                    "evidence": "\"(c) ... scrolls here with a one-time highlight fade and moves focus to the card title.\" \"(b) Tapping 'See what this earns' on the confirmation after sharing the link.\"",
                    "fix": "Add a frame: \"f9-invite-rewards-card · web-1440 · 18b-landing-from-block-founders · light — the highlight fading and a focus ring on 'Invite rewards'\" (renumber, keeping at most 6 per turn). Add \"See what this earns\" to Notes' invented strings, owned by the post-share confirmation."
                  },
                  {
                    "severity": "minor",
                    "issue": "The visible joined rows don't state the same stage as their spoken labels.",
                    "evidence": "Visible: \"Luis M. · joined Thu 1 Oct\". Spoken: \"Luis M., joined October 1, address not verified yet.\"",
                    "fix": "Change the visible rows to \"Luis M. · joined Thu 1 Oct · address not verified yet\" and \"Hannah K. · joined Tue 13 Oct · address not verified yet\", or remove the extra clause from the spoken labels."
