                    "evidence": "house-style-v2.txt FIXTURES: \"Bills: Clark Public Utilities $142.18 due Fri 23 Oct; City of Vancouver water $84.00 due Wed 28 Oct; Comcast $79.99 due Mon 2 Nov. HOA dues $285 due Sun 1 Nov.\" Prompt row 1: Clark Public Utilities \"$142.18 · due Fri 23 Oct\"; row 4: Larkspur Loop HOA \"$285.00 · due Sun 1 Nov\".",
                    "fix": "On the Notes artboard, state that the house fixture bills are what exists after tonight's confirmations, so these rows are not yet on the bills list. Also say how the HOA row relates to the existing HOA dues Date (for example, the duplicate check covers Dates of kind HOA dues)."
                  },
