                    "evidence": "Prompt: \"One is still uploading, one failed, two have been read\"; extraction prompt: \"automatically after 'Done (4)' in the capture tray, once the first piece has been read\" and \"Just-file frame (Piece 4 of 4): Chase\"; tray: \"pages 6–8 Chase statement ... page 8 failed\".",
