              "Needs you line now carries a weekday date: 'The Clark Public Utilities bill was due Fri 23 Oct. 1 more due in the next 7 days.' (review minor)",
              "PLACE B frame gets pose and caption and a final period on 'Pickup tomorrow.'; DONE WHEN count parity covers 11 and 6 (review minor, flow-09 step 7)",
              "Sam's menu is now 'Hide keeper for now' plus a disabled 'Rename' item with subtitle 'Only Maya can rename, change or remove this keeper.'; LockedActionRow removed from the strip (review minor x2)",
              "Hide keeper opens a platform submenu; Undo line adds the relative count; artboard renamed to hide-submenu (review minor)",
              "Settings path aligned with the naming prompt (Keeper row opens the sheet); hidden keeper restored via 'Show Ollie on Today' on the place-file Keeper row, added to COPY and invented strings (review minor)",
