              "Selection is dot plus bold label only (2px outline removed); artboard 17 shows focus ring on heron while otter is selected (review minor, contract KindGlyph)",
              "Added status lines 'Renamed to Olive.' and 'Ollie is a Red fox now.' (Olive used instead of Pepper to avoid clashing with Jordan's fox); Close during saving defined (review minor)",
