              "Notes: Ollie = River otter per fixture; flow-09 step 4 and scope wording flagged for update; v1/round-1 history removed (review minor x2)",
              "Removal on the strip now referenced as immediate with Undo; DestructiveConfirm reference removed and its variant flagged for retirement, matching the strip prompt",
