                    "evidence": "component-contract.md BillRow: \"Overflow menu holds Mark paid / I paid this / Paid a different amount / Skip this month.\" and doNot \"No one-tap Mark paid on the row face or dashboard.\" The prompt says: \"The needs-you bill lands on its BillRow with 'Already paid?' beside 'Mark paid'.\"",
                    "fix": "Land on the BillRow in its 'highlighted from notification' state. Deliver the correction through the row's existing path (the overflow's Mark paid / I paid this, or bill detail). If a visible correction prompt is kept, draw it as a caption line under the highlighted row that opens the overflow, not as a peer button next to Mark paid. List \"Already paid?\" on Notes as a deviation that needs a contract decision."
                  },
