                    "fix": "On Notes, add: \"Doc → prompt: relaxed→Calm, attentive→On it, fidgeting→Busy, worried→Needs you. Strings changed per research (rolling 7 days, the thing as subject, glossary 'Recycling and garbage'). The doc's 'knows N things' growth line is dropped (FactCount copyRules: never 'knows').\""
