                    "evidence": "The prompt says: \"Shown only when every check succeeded; the host's QuietDayReceipt is fully ticked.\" component-contract QuietDayReceipt: \"one row of four CheckItems: weather · air · alerts · your calendar\". inventory uxNote: \"Mail and bill counts are wrapped in .catch(() => 0) ... a broken query renders as a cheerful 'relaxed' on the day a bill is overdue\".",
